    "tempted": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
        {"zh": "苍白光环闪烁着邪恶光芒。", "en": "Pale glow emits dark light."},
        {"zh": "它向你投来饥饿的目光。", "en": "It stares hungrily at you."},
        {"zh": "它靠近你，发出嘶嘶声。", "en": "It hisses as it approaches."},
        {"zh": "苍白的触手缠绕着你。", "en": "Pale tendrils wrap around you."},
        {"zh": "它尝试舔食你的皮肤。", "en": "It tries to lick your skin."},
        {"zh": "它在你周围盘旋，寻找机会。", "en": "It circles you, seeking an opening."},
        {"zh": "它似乎对你充满欲望。", "en": "It seems欲言又止, longing for you."},
        {"zh": "它张开嘴巴，准备噬咬。", "en": "It opens its mouth, ready to bite."},
